+    *   Combine losses with weights:
+        $$ \mathcal{L}_{total} = \mathcal{L}_{point} + \lambda_{eik} \mathcal{L}_{eikonal} + \lambda_{inter} \mathcal{L}_{inter} $$
+    *   Perform backpropagation: `optimizer.zero_grad()`, `loss.backward()`, `optimizer.step()`.
